{"id":"n60565-1-10","stage":5,"title":"빈혈 · 贫血","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60565-1-10-1","ko":"아, 어지러워. 나 빈혈이 생겼나 봐.","zh":"啊，我头晕。看来我是贫血了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"咦","explanation":"아：咦","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"1","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}},{"text":"어지러워.","meaning":"晕，晕眩","explanation":"어지럽다：晕，晕眩；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어지럽다","audio":"/audio/1e2f790342e5cbb65c1d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14588","senseId":"1","lemma":"어지럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어지러워","audio":"/audio/0832c6b3f9b9997e5f66.mp3"}},{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}},{"text":"빈혈이","meaning":"贫血","explanation":"빈혈：贫血；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"빈혈","audio":"/audio/d32f2674aa507a630b59.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60565","senseId":"1","lemma":"빈혈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"빈혈이","audio":"/audio/f0a58b4821ddffe634a1.mp3"}},{"text":"생겼나","meaning":"有，出现","explanation":"생기다：有，出现；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"생기다","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67898","senseId":"1","lemma":"생기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생겼나","audio":"/audio/5264431e9730346fd5d3.mp3"}},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","explanation":"보다：看来、好像（根据情况推测）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62249","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"봐","audio":"/audio/fdcffec86114c54dd4e0.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"咦","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"感到惊讶、慌张、焦急、急促时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"1e2f790342e5cbb6","term":"어지럽다","zh":"晕，晕眩","audio":"/audio/1e2f790342e5cbb65c1d.mp3","entryId":"14588","definition":"感觉周围的所有事物都在旋转一般而无法控制身体。","pronunciation":["어지럽따"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"d32f2674aa507a63","term":"빈혈","zh":"贫血","audio":"/audio/d32f2674aa507a630b59.mp3","entryId":"60565","definition":"血液中用来运送氧的成分减少而低于正常数值的状态。","pronunciation":["빈혈"]},{"id":"fc2a5a2e23bd6357","term":"생기다","zh":"有，出现","audio":"/audio/fc2a5a2e23bd6357d176.mp3","entryId":"67898","definition":"新增了原本没有的东西。","pronunciation":["생기다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62249","definition":"看来、好像（根据情况推测）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c4abf6cb181162f2bd2b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60565-1-10-2","ko":"병원에 가서 꼭 검사하고 치료를 받아.","zh":"一定要去医院做检查并接受治疗。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"병원에","meaning":"医院","explanation":"병원：医院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"병원","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62271","senseId":"1","lemma":"병원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"병원에","audio":"/audio/2610e1319b7ca0517a20.mp3"}},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가서","audio":"/audio/0a4296790d3f4b0e6e6b.mp3"}},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"一定，必定","explanation":"꼭：一定，必定","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}},{"text":"검사하고","meaning":"检查，检验","explanation":"검사하다：检查，检验；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"검사하다","audio":"/audio/81227391e5628414baa0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"25239","senseId":"1","lemma":"검사하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"검사하고","audio":"/audio/b2ce769dece7a2f3e2f0.mp3"}},{"text":"치료를","meaning":"治疗","explanation":"치료：治疗；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"치료","audio":"/audio/6f44a9c1f36d86e996c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83170","senseId":"1","lemma":"치료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"치료를","audio":"/audio/8d768130adca62c12574.mp3"}},{"text":"받아.","meaning":"接，接受","explanation":"받다：接，接受；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"9","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받아","audio":"/audio/0a0a7a563f5137f6e18d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"4f4c2d79c47ca512","term":"병원","zh":"医院","audio":"/audio/4f4c2d79c47ca512edb7.mp3","entryId":"62271","definition":"具备相关设施、由医生和护士治疗病人的地方。","pronunciation":["병ː원"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"712da780b7ecf8b7","term":"꼭","zh":"一定，必定","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3","entryId":"48064","definition":"无论有什么事情也务必。","pronunciation":["꼭"]},{"id":"81227391e5628414","term":"검사하다","zh":"检查，检验","audio":"/audio/81227391e5628414baa0.mp3","entryId":"25239","definition":"调查某事或某个对象，查出对错或好坏等。","pronunciation":["검ː사하다"]},{"id":"6f44a9c1f36d86e9","term":"치료","zh":"治疗","audio":"/audio/6f44a